  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Inclusive Knowledge and Capacity for Sustainable Resource Management, Biodiversity, and Disaster Resilience including in Biosphere Reserves</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive knowledge and capacities of Ethiopia strengthened to advance and apply science for sustainable management of natural resources, ecosystem and biodiversity conservation and restoration, and disaster risk resilience. SC/ADI will support Ethiopia in 1) enhancing the resilience of UNESCO Biosphere Reserves, 2) strengthening risk governance MAB Committee and Youth Networks and 3) empowering women and youth to build a sustainable future.</narrative>
